  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "ARC Raiders - Deluxe Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/21041/450x258/arc-raiders-deluxe-edition-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1793970000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/21041-buy-arc-raiders-deluxe-edition-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Brat4300",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/4573851-1587966479.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Absolutely loving Arc Raiders. Been raiding solo and with a friend, and somehow haven’t run into any PvP yet—which is great, because my PvP strategy is mostly panic followed by a generous loot donation.\n\n\n\nMy biggest enemy so far is storage space. Apparently, picking up everything that isn’t nailed down has consequences. Do I need all this stuff? No idea. Am I keeping it? Obviously.\n\n\n\nAlso, I hate ticks. The little flying ARCs are easy enough, except for that blowtorch one. That thing can go directly to hell. It’s clearly familiar with the temperature.\n\n\n\nMeanwhile, it’s grind, grind, grind for those upgrades so I can become better equipped to bring home more things I have nowhere to put.\n\n\n\nHaving a blast. My inventory is not."
    },
    {
      "game": "Beyond These Stars",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/21557/450x258/beyond-these-stars-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1793970000",
